Adds nvkmd_info.has_sparse, true on nouveau, and offers sparse binding and
residency, and reports their address space and properties, only where it is
set, since each queue of a family with sparse binding asks the nvkmd for a
bind ctx (an nvkmd's object that binds memory to a sparse resource's pages).

